{"4682030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombobox: Bredo Story", "steam_appid": 4682030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time for STORIES</strong>! Listen to Tolyan's whole story about his incredible adventures in Zombagrad and how he defeated all the zombies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Tolyan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tolyan is an ordinary guy with an extraordinary destiny. Armed with courage, sharp jokes, and unstoppable determination, he is the only one ready to stand against the zombie chaos that swallowed Zombagrad.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/b9390c195a30158416668c718416f48e.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/b9390c195a30158416668c718416f48e.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/b9390c195a30158416668c718416f48e.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill the zombies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through endless waves of hungry undead, blast them into pieces, and clear the streets one battle at a time. Fast action, explosions, and pure survival await you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/c928fbe82f44dd17fe930a3f375dbb31.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/c928fbe82f44dd17fe930a3f375dbb31.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/c928fbe82f44dd17fe930a3f375dbb31.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From classic pistols and shotguns to wild experimental tools of destruction — choose your favorite way to send zombies back to the grave.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/88ee8eee00245c28e4a345150382e530.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/88ee8eee00245c28e4a345150382e530.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/88ee8eee00245c28e4a345150382e530.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined streets, abandoned rooftops, secret laboratories, and the craziest corners of Zombagrad. Every location brings new dangers and surprises.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/a695c4204fe908ffc48b017c11f74440.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/a695c4204fe908ffc48b017c11f74440.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/a695c4204fe908ffc48b017c11f74440.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic zombie battles with chaotic action and explosive moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons to unlock and master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique locations filled with traps, secrets, and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny story campaign starring Tolyan and his crazy adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls and fast-paced gameplay anyone can enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies that require skill and quick reactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time for STORIES</strong>! Listen to Tolyan's whole story about his incredible adventures in Zombagrad and how he defeated all the zombies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Tolyan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tolyan is an ordinary guy with an extraordinary destiny. Armed with courage, sharp jokes, and unstoppable determination, he is the only one ready to stand against the zombie chaos that swallowed Zombagrad.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/b9390c195a30158416668c718416f48e.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/b9390c195a30158416668c718416f48e.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/b9390c195a30158416668c718416f48e.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kill the zombies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through endless waves of hungry undead, blast them into pieces, and clear the streets one battle at a time. Fast action, explosions, and pure survival await you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/c928fbe82f44dd17fe930a3f375dbb31.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/c928fbe82f44dd17fe930a3f375dbb31.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/c928fbe82f44dd17fe930a3f375dbb31.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From classic pistols and shotguns to wild experimental tools of destruction — choose your favorite way to send zombies back to the grave.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/88ee8eee00245c28e4a345150382e530.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/88ee8eee00245c28e4a345150382e530.webm?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/88ee8eee00245c28e4a345150382e530.mp4?t=1784141464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined streets, abandoned rooftops, secret laboratories, and the craziest corners of Zombagrad. Every location brings new dangers and surprises.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/extras/a695c4204fe908ffc48b017c11f74440.poster.avif?t=1784141464\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4682030/